              "value": [
                {
                  "resource_id": "levelled_description",
                  "stats": {
                    "level": {
                      "value": 1
                    },
                    "description": {
                      "value": "You are naturally proficient in the History skill, and you can double your proficiency bonus for it when you make an Intelligence (History) check to recall information you have learned, or to recall the details of your experiences. Your Intelligence (History) check can only benefit from this if it does not already benefit from a feature or trait that allows you to double your proficiency bonus for it."
